SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri\, Korthi
LOCATION:Korthi\, Andros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Korthi bay in the south is the island's best-known 15 August panigiri: liturgy and procession\, then froutalia and soumada (almond cordial) in the square with island instruments and dancing. The same night Livadia and Makrotantalo in the north\, and Ammolos and Pano Katakoilos hold their own glentia\, and in Chora the seaside chapel of Panagia Thalassini celebrates.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/andros/#korthi-dormition-panigiri-korthi
